CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS settings (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY CHECK (id=1), symbols TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '["2330"]', flags TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '{"BUY IN":true,"SELL IN":true,"PROFIT OUT":true,"FAIL OUT":true}', volume_ratio REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 1.2, updated_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO settings(id) VALUES(1);
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS subscriptions (token_hash TEXT PRIMARY KEY, fcm_token TEXT NOT NULL, platform TEXT NOT NULL, created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, updated_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, active INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1);
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS candles (symbol TEXT NOT NULL, ts TEXT NOT NULL, open REAL NOT NULL, high REAL NOT NULL, low REAL NOT NULL, close REAL NOT NULL, volume REAL NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY(symbol,ts));
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS candles_time_idx ON candles(symbol,ts DESC);
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS cache_state (symbol TEXT PRIMARY KEY, last_historical_day TEXT, updated_at TEXT);
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS events (id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, symbol TEXT NOT NULL, strategy TEXT NOT NULL, kind TEXT NOT NULL, bar_ts TEXT NOT NULL, created_at TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, UNIQUE(symbol,strategy,kind,bar_ts));
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS deliveries (event_id TEXT NOT NULL, token_hash TEXT NOT NULL, status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending', attempts INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, claimed_at INTEGER, sent_at TEXT, last_error TEXT, PRIMARY KEY(event_id,token_hash));
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS health (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY CHECK(id=1), last_run TEXT, last_ok TEXT, error TEXT);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO health(id) VALUES(1);
